// AccountAdminService is the account moderation surface (issue 32): list/search,
// role changes, block/unblock and account creation. Before it, role and block
// were only editable with psql.
//
// Authorization is re-read server-side from account.role on every call: list/get
// need moderator or admin; role changes and creation need admin; a moderator may
// only block/unblock players. Rules that must never be bypassed live inside the
// write transaction, not here: nobody changes their own role/block, the last
// ACTIVE admin cannot be demoted or blocked, and every write appends
// account_admin_audit with old/new value and the typed reason.
//
// Nothing here touches live game state. account.role and account.is_blocked are
// consulted on the NEXT login (game and web), so the panel says so explicitly.
